Source: cuda-devel-ohpc
Section: science
Priority: optional
Maintainer: VersatusHPC <packages@versatushpc.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: cuda-devel-ohpc
Architecture: all
Depends: ohpc-filesystem, lmod-ohpc, ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenHPC compatibility package for CUDA (OpenHPC)
 Provides OpenHPC-style modulefiles for NVIDIA CUDA/HPC SDK.
 Requires NVIDIA HPC SDK to be installed at /opt/nvidia/hpc_sdk/.

Package: cuda-repo-ohpc
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: CUDA toolkit repository configuration (OpenHPC)
 Provides repository configuration for NVIDIA CUDA toolkit.
